[center][img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adrirf7/HideFriendMapPings/main/docs/header.jpg[/img][/center]

[center][size=4][color=#ECA830][b]Choose which pins and map areas you see[/b][/color][/size]
[size=3][color=#D8CFC2]Your map is buried under other players' pins, areas you've never been to, or your own old markers?
Hide the shared map, the shared pins or your own pins with one click, and bring them back whenever you want.[/color][/size][/center]

[line]

[size=5][color=#ECA830][b]The problem[/b][/color][/size]

[size=3]Read the cartography table once on a busy server and this is what your map turns into: hundreds of other players' pins and names piled on top of each other, until you can't find your own base, your portals or where you have actually been. The game only lets you hide [b]everything[/b] shared at once, map and pins together.[/size]

[center][img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adrirf7/HideFriendMapPings/main/docs/cluttered_map.jpg[/img]
[size=2][color=#A89F94][i]A real map after reading the cartography table on a shared server[/i][/color][/size][/center]

[size=3][color=#ECA830][b]MapPinFilter[/b][/color] lets you hide the shared map, the shared pins and even your own pins [b]separately[/b], so you can keep the explored terrain and drop the clutter, or the other way round.[/size]

[line]

[size=5][color=#ECA830][b]Features[/b][/color][/size]

[list]
[*][size=3][color=#ECA830][b]Shared map[/b][/color] - show or hide the areas other players explored. Only the areas [b]you[/b] explored stay uncovered, on the large map and on the minimap.[/size]
[*][size=3][color=#ECA830][b]Shared pins[/b][/color] - show or hide the pins other players shared with you through the cartography table.[/size]
[*][size=3][color=#ECA830][b]My pins[/b][/color] - show or hide your own pins (the ones you placed, your tombstones and discovered bosses). Player markers and pings are never hidden.[/size]
[*][size=3][color=#ECA830][b]Independent[/b][/color] - each checkbox works on its own. They replace the game's "Cartography Table" checkbox, which could only hide the shared map and pins together.[/size]
[*][size=3][color=#ECA830][b]Nothing is deleted[/b][/color] - it only changes what you see. Tick the box again and everything is back.[/size]
[*][size=3][color=#ECA830][b]Remembered[/b][/color] - the checkboxes keep their state between sessions.[/size]
[*][size=3][color=#ECA830][b]Safe[/b][/color] - hidden pins can't be removed by accident with a click.[/size]
[*][size=3][color=#ECA830][b]Translated[/b][/color] - follows the game language (14 languages, English for the rest).[/size]
[*][size=3][color=#ECA830][b]Client-side only[/b][/color] - other players and the server don't need it.[/size]
[/list]

[center][img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adrirf7/HideFriendMapPings/main/docs/map_toggles.png[/img]
[size=2][color=#A89F94][i]The new checkboxes, above "Visible to other players"[/i][/color][/size][/center]

[line]

[size=5][color=#ECA830][b]How to use[/b][/color][/size]

[size=3]1. Open the large map ([color=#ECA830][b]M[/b][/color]).
2. In the bottom-right corner, above [b]Visible to other players[/b], tick or untick [color=#ECA830][b]Shared map[/b][/color], [color=#ECA830][b]Shared pins[/b][/color] and [color=#ECA830][b]My pins[/b][/color].[/size]

[line]

[size=5][color=#ECA830][b]Configuration[/b][/color][/size]

[size=3]File: [font=Courier New]BepInEx/config/HideFriendMapPings.adrirf7.cfg[/font][/size]

[list]
[*][size=3][color=#ECA830][b]ShowSharedPins[/b][/color] [color=#A89F94](default: true)[/color] - show the pins shared through the cartography table.[/size]
[*][size=3][color=#ECA830][b]ShowSharedMap[/b][/color] [color=#A89F94](default: true)[/color] - show the map areas explored by other players.[/size]
[*][size=3][color=#ECA830][b]ShowOwnPins[/b][/color] [color=#A89F94](default: true)[/color] - show your own pins.[/size]
[*][size=3][color=#ECA830][b]TogglesOffset[/b][/color] [color=#A89F94](default: 0, 0)[/color] - moves the checkboxes by this many pixels (x = right, y = up), in case another mod uses that spot.[/size]
[/list]

[line]

[size=5][color=#ECA830][b]Installation[/b][/color][/size]

[size=3]1. Install [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/valheim/mods/4]BepInExPack Valheim[/url].
2. Extract [font=Courier New]MapPinFilter-1.0.0-nexus.zip[/font] into your Valheim folder, so the DLL ends up in [font=Courier New]BepInEx/plugins/HideFriendMapPings/[/font].
3. Done. Only you need it, it works on any server.[/size]

[size=5][color=#ECA830][b]Languages[/b][/color][/size]

[size=2][color=#D8CFC2]English, Spanish, German, French, Italian, Portuguese (Brazil and Portugal), Russian, Ukrainian, Polish, Chinese (Simplified and Traditional), Japanese and Korean.[/color][/size]

[line]

[center][size=2][color=#A89F94]Source code: [url=https://github.com/adrirf7/HideFriendMapPings]github.com/adrirf7/HideFriendMapPings[/url][/color][/size][/center]
